@startuml
title SD4 : Coordination between notifications

' The source image labels the lifeline that answers the TMF667 Document Management
' call "Party Management"; kept as drawn.

actor Recipient
participant "Customer Bill" as CB
participant "Billing Account Management" as BAM
participant "//Communication Interaction Management//" as CIM
participant "Party Management" as PM
participant "Channel Transport" as CT

CB -> CIM : 1 **TMF681** POST /communicationMessage\n(receiver[].party.id="Alice",\ncontent="Your September bill is ready. EUR 61.99.",\nattachment[{id="bill-4471-2026-09"}],\ncharacteristic[messageClass="statutory"], priority="normal")
activate CIM
CIM --> CB : 2 **TMF681** 201 Created (state="initial")
CIM -> PM : 3 **TMF667 Document Management**\nGET /document/bill-4471-2026-09
activate PM
PM --> CIM : 4 **TMF667** 200 OK\n(name, documentType="bill", lifecycleState,\nbinaryAttachment[{mimeType="application/pdf", url,\nsize{amount, units}, validFor}])
deactivate PM
note right of PM
  TMF667 binaryAttachment[] and TMF681 attachment[] carry
  the same fields, so the document maps into the message
  without transformation (5.1.1). The document is
  referenced, never copied - Document Management remains
  the store (X5).
end note

BAM -> CIM : 5 **TMF681** POST /communicationMessage\n(receiver[].party.id="Alice",\ncontent="Your account is EUR 48.60 overdue ...",\ncharacteristic[messageClass="regulatory"], priority="high")
CIM --> BAM : 6 **TMF681** 201 Created (state="initial")

CIM -> CIM : 7 coordinate — both address Alice within the same hour:\narrears ("high") before bill ("normal"); minimum spacing;\nhold time by class; daily frequency cap not reached
CIM -> CT : 8 dispatch the arrears notice first
activate CT
CT --> Recipient : 9 "Your account is EUR 48.60 overdue. Pay by\n26 Sep to avoid restriction."
deactivate CT
CIM -> CIM : 10 hold the bill notice for the spacing interval
CIM -> CT : 11 dispatch the bill notice\n(SMS cannot carry a PDF, so the rendered message\ncarries the binaryAttachment url instead)
activate CT
CT --> Recipient : 12 "Your September bill is ready. EUR 61.99.\nView it here: vf.com/b/4471"
deactivate CT
deactivate CIM
note over CIM
  Customer Bill cannot know an arrears notice is in flight,
  and Account Management cannot know a bill notice is, as
  each sees only its own traffic (C3). GB1033 v24.0 contains
  no function for this determination. Recorded in §5.2.
end note

@enduml
